#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Početak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kuser; allows you to manage users and groups on your system."
msgstr ""
"&kuser;  Vam omogućava upravljanje korisnicima i grupama na Vašem sistemu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a short introduction to &kuser;. For more detailed information, see "
"<link linkend=\"using\">Usage</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je kratki uvod u &kuser;. Za više detaljnih informacija, pogledajte "
"<link linkend=\"korištenje\">Usage</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Actually, you do not need to do anything to begin using &kuser; except <link "
"linkend=\"customizing\">configuration</link>."
msgstr ""
"U suštini, ne trebate ništa da uradite da biste počeli koristiti &kuser; "
"osim <link linkend=\"customizing\">configuration</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you do not launch &kuser; in administrator mode, you will get a warning, "
"that the file <filename>/etc/shadow</filename> is not readable."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne pokrenete &kuser; kao administrator, dobit ćete upozorenje, to da "
"datoteka <filename>/etc/shadow</filename> nije čitljiva."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Korištenje"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main Window"
msgstr "Glavni prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kuser; is a very simple application. In the main window you can see two "
"tabs: the list of users and the list of groups. To edit a user or a group, "
"just click on it. The user or group properties dialog will appear."
msgstr ""
"&kuser;  je veoma jednostavna aplikacija. U glavnom prozoru možete vidjeti "
"dvije kartice: lista korisnika i lista grupa. Da bi uredili korisnika ili "
"grupa, samo kliknite na njih. Dijalog svojstava korisnika ili grupe će se "
"pojaviti."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kuser; Main Window</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kuser; Glavni prozor</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kuser; Main Window</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kuser; Glavni prozor</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "User and Group Properties"
msgstr "Svojstva korisnika i grupe"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "User Properties Dialog"
msgstr "Dijalog korisničkih svojstava"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "The user properties dialog has two tabs."
msgstr "Dijalog korisničkih svojstava ima dvije kartice."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "User Info Tab"
msgstr "Kartica korisničkog info-a"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "In the <guilabel>User Info</guilabel> tab you can modify:"
msgstr "U <guilabel>Korisnički info</guilabel> možete modifikovati:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>User login</guilabel> with the user name and a <guibutton>Set "
"Password</guibutton> button for this account,"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Korisnička prijava</guilabel>sa korisničkim imenom i "
"<guibutton>Postavi šifru</guibutton>dugme za ovaj račun,"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "User Id"
msgstr "Korisnički Id"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "Full Name"
msgstr "Puno ime"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Login Shell</guilabel> (the list of login shells is taken from the "
"<filename>/etc/shells</filename> file)"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Školjka prijave</guilabel> (lista školjki prijave je preuzeta sa "
"<filename>/etc/shells</filename> file)"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "Home Folder"
msgstr "Folder naslovnice"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two office locations"
msgstr "Dvije lokacije ureda"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Address"
msgstr "Adresa"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "Account disabled"
msgstr "Račun onesposobljen"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "Password Management Tab"
msgstr "Kartice upravljanja šiframa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Password Management</guilabel> tab will appear in "
"administrator mode if you have shadow passwords, or any other similar things "
"such as <filename>/etc/master.passwd</filename> in <acronym>BSD</acronym> "
"flavor Unices."
msgstr ""
"Kartica <guilabel>Upravljanje šiframa</guilabel> će se pojaviti u "
"administratorskom načinu ako imate pozadinske šifre, ili neke slične stvari "
"kao  <filename>/etc/master.passwd</filename> u <acronym>BSD</acronym> "
"vrstama Unix-a."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimum number of days between password changes"
msgstr "Minimalni broj dana između promjene šifre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of days after which a password expires if it hasn't been changed"
msgstr "Broj dana nakon kojih šifra ističe ako nije promijenjena"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of days before expiration the user will be warned"
msgstr "Broj dana prije isteka kada će korisnik biti upozoren"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "Whether and when an account will be disabled if the password expires"
msgstr "Da li će i kada račun biti onesposobljen ako šifra istekne"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "A set date when the account expires"
msgstr "Postavka datuma kada račun istekne"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Class</guilabel> (on <acronym>BSD</acronym> systems)"
msgstr "<guilabel>Class</guilabel> (on <acronym>BSD</acronym> systems)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The date of the last password change is displayed near the top of the dialog."
msgstr "Datum zadnje promjene šifre je prikazan pored vrha dijaloga."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "Groups Tab"
msgstr "Kartice grupe"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Groups</guilabel> tab contains all the information about the "
"selected user's participation in groups. The primary group to which the user "
"belongs is set with the <guilabel>Set as Primary</guilabel> button. The user "
"can be assigned to additional groups by checking them in the large box."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Groups</guilabel>  kartice sadrže sve informacije o sudjelovanju "
"odabranog korisnika u grupama. Primarna grupa kojoj korisnik pripada je "
"postavljena sa  <guilabel>Postavi kao primarno</guilabel> dugmetom. Korisnik "
"može biti dodijeljen u dodatne skupine provjeravanjem njih  u velikim "
"kutijama."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid "Group Properties"
msgstr "Svojstva grupe"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Group Properties</guilabel> dialog contains a list of all "
"users in the selected group on the left and a list of all other users."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Svojstva grupe</guilabel> dijalog sadrži listu svih korisnika "
"odabrane grupe lijevo i listu svih ostalih korisnika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select a user in one of both lists and use the <guibutton>Add</guibutton> "
"and <guibutton>Remove</guibutton> buttons to manage members of the group."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite korisnika u jednoj od obje grupe i koristite <guibutton>Dodaj</"
"guibutton> i <guibutton>Ukloni</guibutton>  dugmad za podešavanje članova "
"grupe."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing Users or Groups"
msgstr "Upravljanje korisnicima i grupama"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a user or group to the system, either choose <guimenuitem>Add</"
"guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>User</guimenu> or <guimenu>Group</guimenu> "
"menu, or click the relevant <guiicon>Add</guiicon> button on the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Da dodate korisnika ili grupu u sistem, ili odaberite <guimenuitem>Dodaj</"
"guimenuitem> iz<guimenu>Korisnik</guimenu>ili <guimenu>Grupa</guimenu>  "
"izbornik, ili kliknite relevantno  <guiicon>Dodaj</guiicon> dugme na traci "
"alata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid "A selected user or group can also be edited or deleted in the same way."
msgstr ""
"Odabrani korisnik ili grupa mogu također biti uređivani ili obrisani na isti "
"način."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing &kuser;"
msgstr "Prilagođavanje &kuser;-a"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid "Edit user creation defaults"
msgstr "Uredi korisnička tvorevinska podešavanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To edit the user creation defaults you can use the <guilabel>Connection</"
"guilabel> tab on the <guilabel>General</guilabel> page of &kuser;'s "
"configuration dialog, which is accessible via the menu "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kuser;</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Da uredite korisnička podrazumijevana podešavanja pri kreiranju možete "
"koristiti <guilabel>Konekcija</guilabel> kartickau na<guilabel>Opšte</"
"guilabel>stranici  &kuser; konfiguracijskog djialoga, koji je dostupan preko "
"izbornika<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši "
"&kuser;</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There you may change the defaults that are used when creating a new user: "
"Shell and Home Folder (or home folders volume). You can choose whether to "
"make a home folder on <quote>create</quote> or not, and to copy a skeleton "
"(standard configuration files) to the home folder or not. You can also "
"enable <guilabel>User private group</guilabel> mechanism, which creates a "
"new personal group with the creation of a new user, and removes the personal "
"group when the user is removed."
msgstr ""
"Tamo možete promijeniti podešavanja koja su korištena prilikom pravljenja "
"novog korisnika. Školjka i početne mape (ili izbornik početne mape). Možete "
"odabrati bilo da napravite početnu mapu na <quote>napravi</quote> ili ne, i "
"da kopirate kostur (standardnu konfiguracijsku datoteku) u početnu mapu ili "
"ne. Možete također omogućiti <guilabel>Korisnička privarna grupa</guilabel> "
"mehanizam, koji pravi novi personalnu grupu  pravljenjem novog korisnika, i "
"briše personalnu grupu kada je korisnik uklonjen."

